            "answer": "<p>It depends on the lot. The city limit runs through both canyons. Many homes with a Beverly Hills mailing address are in the City of Los Angeles, where permits go through LADBS. Homes inside the city line go through the Beverly Hills Community Development Department. Both apply the California code with its 42\" guard minimum. Check the jurisdiction of your parcel before you submit drawings.</p>",
